# Adapters Directory

This directory contains third-party system adapters.

Each adapter should have:
- manifest.yaml  - Capability declaration
- adapter.py     - Implementation
- types.py       - Domain types
- verify.py      - Verification helpers
- README.md      - Usage documentation

Example adapters to create:
- hubspot/       - HubSpot CRM
- slack/         - Slack messaging
- google-docs/   - Google Docs
- google-drive/  - Google Drive
- gitlab/        - GitLab
- github/        - GitHub
- aws-s3/        - AWS S3
- postgres/      - PostgreSQL database

See docs/architecture.md for adapter guidelines.
